        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi ghoang'waay Raba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghang'eat ghuuta gweayda, damanda beawa sugoocheanda ng'ucheeda, hean goosheedeawa Yoabu lugooda, ak ghaghas ng'eanyiida fuga Amoni, ak ghwaan ghoang'waay Raba. Nea Dawdi niny goobiida Yerusalemu. Ak ghabwar Yoabu Raba, ak ghabwaay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageanda Dawdi ngoofajeanda aba uhuuda sugoocheanda nyaawa, ak ghwadaah gideaba durumanataanyi ghwahita dalaanteeda dahaabu, nea gwanda jeeda lagheaneeda sheayeeda haw; ak geayiin uhuuda Dawdi. Ak gweadu haleanjeeda siyaas aba mujiini, duguuga saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gweadu buuneeda mida jeeda, ak ghwanung' gagadiyeata musumeenajeega ea sululajeega ea joomajeega; ak gwasindunu Dawdi aba mujiinajeega sean bea fuga Amoni. Ng'ata gabiikta Dawdi sea buuneesean Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'ucheeda sea fuga majeekcheewi bea Filisti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghang'ata ng'asheesu ghang'eat ng'ucheeda sea fuga Filisti aba Geseri; hean ghabwar Sibekayi bea eemeeda Hushati Sipayi, was siyagi bea jeacheenga fuga majeekcheewi; ak geajoar fuga Filisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu gabiikta ghang'eat ng'ucheeda gicha sea fuga Filisti; ak Elhanani was orjeeda Yairo ghabwar Lahmi was orjeeda geenyea Goliyati bea eemeeda Giti, deena murguuda ng'utaanyi darearjeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabiikta ghang'eat ng'ucheeda gicha aba Gati, mida siida geaw muuchi, mideawa moorin lah aba giliwas geadi, nea gaba geeshi mideawa moorin lah, nea mooringa sean ea diktam ea ang'wan; nea eara niny gaba jeacheenga fuga majeekcheewi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea goong'eawi Israeli, ghabwar Yonatan was orjeeda Shimeya, was orjeeda geenyea Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiisu gaba jeacheenga fuga majeekcheewi mida Gati, ak gameewa aba geatinga Dawdi ea aba geatinga fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
